      "content": "That's a great start. I really like the idea of the physical differences. To make it even more impactful, I want to lean into the \"raw\" aspect of the Low-Tier. When describing them in a crowd, how would you describe their typical facial features or hair textures to make them look more \"unrefined\" or \"primitive\" compared to the polished High-Tier? I want to avoid making them look like the High-Tier, just... more primal.",
